intro:
  heading: "Expert Parking Lot Construction & Resurfacing"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      S. Phaneuf & Associates specializes in commercial parking lot paving, milling, and resurfacing for shopping centers, commercial office buildings, industrial facilities, and apartment complexes throughout Massachusetts. A commercial parking lot is a high-impact asset that must withstand constant vehicle weight, delivery truck turns, and winter snowplowing.
    - >
      We evaluate structural pavement integrity to recommend the most cost-effective solution: whether a full-depth asphalt replacement or a 2-inch hot-mix asphalt overlay. Our paving crews handle catch basin adjustments, Cape Cod berm extrusions, and ADA-compliant handicap parking stall layouts.
    - >
      Protect your commercial property investment with long-lasting asphalt paving engineered for Massachusetts weather conditions.

